<attribute name="version" nodeId="ff297925"></attribute>
<attribute name="mainDescription" nodeId="79a6d77f">&lt;p&gt;
    As part of this task, understand what the source system is expected to provide (e.g., 100% of the required data, base
    record, enrichment of base records, critical updates to otherwise static data, etc.) and accordingly identify all
    potential source systems for each required data entity. Additionally, determine authoritative sources of data for each
    entity across all the source systems (discussions with the business and alignment to the data governance structure may
    be required in order to determine the true and accurate data source).
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    Gather the unique identifiers at the record level and create a mapping of each source entity to target system.
    Determine whether the source systems will need to be modified in order to provide the necessary data and if any
    filtering criteria may need to be applied to the source systemd from which data will be obtained. Understanding
    availability and operating windows, recovery time frames and strategy, processing jobs and windows, etc. for each soure
    system is also suggested.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    Where data is requested, but is not available, organize discussions, bringing up suggested resolution options and
    documenting the approach that is selected to obtain the missing data entities.
&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;</attribute>
<attribute name="externalId" nodeId="84c6fff4"></attribute>
<attribute name="keyConsiderations" nodeId="d5f3ba8b">&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        If source systems are evolving or being updated, ensure change management procedures are applied to capture any
        changes to source systems
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        If source systems are being retired or replaced, their dependencies should be evaluated
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</attribute>
<attribute name="longPresentationName" nodeId="93d38b13"></attribute>
<attribute name="purpose" nodeId="b328d40c">To facilitate the extraction of data needed by users or target systems from source systems.</attribute>
<attribute name="alternatives" nodeId="df696d2a"></attribute>
